        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\n&#39; 设置条件判断节点样式\nskinparam Condition {\n  BorderColor #FF0000      &#39; 红色边框\n  BackgroundColor #FFFFCC  &#39; 浅黄色背景\n  BorderThickness 2        &#39; 边框加粗\n  FontColor #000000        &#39; 黑色字体\n}\n\nstart\n:训练监控组件;\n:上报监控指标、节点心跳;\nif (训练进程中断?) then (是)\n  :尝试重启训练进程;\nelse (否)\n  :继续常规监控;\nendif\nstop\n@enduml\n&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="tF5kDbO_WVZEeCOQ9knl-62">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontFamily=Verdana;" parent="1" vertex="1">
