  <diagram id="x0adVqVRSrWI8MYka64k" name="级别划分">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3341" dy="2035" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n&#39; 定义顶层父类：训练故障\nabstract class TrainingFault {\n    + String faultLevel\n    + String faultDescription\n    + void handleFault()\n}\n\n&#39; 进程级中断故障\nclass ProcessError extends TrainingFault {\n    + String exitCode\n    + String processState\n    + void detectProcessExit()\n    + void recoverWithCheckpoint()\n}\n\n&#39; 容器级中断故障\nclass ContainerError extends TrainingFault {\n    + String containerExitReason\n    + String k8sEvent\n    + void detectContainerFailure()\n    + void restartContainerUsingK8sAPI()\n}\n\n&#39; 节点级中断故障\nclass NodeError extends TrainingFault {\n    + String gpuStatus\n    + String nodeHeartbeat\n    + void monitorNodeHealth()\n    + void isolateFaultyNode()\n    + void rescheduleTasks()\n    + void reconstructNetworkTopology()\n}\n\n&#39; 任务级中断故障\nclass JobError extends TrainingFault {\n    + String resourceQuota\n    + String userCodeError\n    + void analyzeJobFailure()\n    + void manualRecovery()\n    + void futureIntelligentRecovery()\n}\n\n&#39; 继承关系\nTrainingFault &lt;|-- ProcessError\nTrainingFault &lt;|-- ContainerError\nTrainingFault &lt;|-- NodeError\nTrainingFault &lt;|-- JobError\n\n&#39; 具体方法和注释\nnote right of ProcessError::detectProcessExit\n    捕获进程退出事件（如SIGTERM、SIGKILL）\nend note\n\nnote right of ProcessError::recoverWithCheckpoint\n    使用内存检查点快速恢复模型状态\nend note\n\nnote right of ContainerError::restartContainerUsingK8sAPI\n    调用Kubernetes API实现容器自动化重启\nend note\n\nnote left of NodeError::isolateFaultyNode\n    使用污点（Taints）隔离故障节点\nend note\n\nnote left of NodeError::rescheduleTasks\n    将任务重新调度到健康节点\nend note\n\nnote left of NodeError::reconstructNetworkTopology\n    重构集合通信拓扑以恢复组网\nend note\n\nnote right of JobError::manualRecovery\n    当前依赖人工干预进行恢复\nend note\n\nnote right of JobError::futureIntelligentRecovery\n    未来可能引入LLM智能体实现自动化恢复\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="WCmOskbB8PCnRr3giRuo-1">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="-1080" y="230" width="1783.41" height="240" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nstart\n\n:检测训练故障;\n\nif (是否发生进程退出事件?) then (是)\n    if (是否存在SIGTERM或SIGKILL?) then (是)\n        :定义为进程级故障;\n        :通过内存检查点恢复模型状态;\n    else (否)\n        :定义为其他类型故障;\n        :记录日志并终止任务;\n    endif\nelseif (是否检测到容器崩溃?) then (是)\n    if (是否因资源不足导致崩溃?) then (是)\n        :定义为容器级资源不足故障;\n        :释放占用资源并重新调度容器;\n    else (否)\n        :定义为容器级代码错误故障;\n        :调用Kubernetes API重启容器;\n    endif\nelseif (是否监控到节点异常?) then (是)\n    if (心跳消失且GPU状态异常?) then (是)\n        :定义为节点级硬件故障;\n        :隔离故障节点并重构通信拓扑;\n    else (否)\n        if (仅心跳消失?) then (是)\n            :定义为节点级网络故障;\n            :标记节点不可用并重新调度任务;\n        else (否)\n            :定义为节点级未知故障;\n            :尝试节点恢复或人工干预;\n        endif\n    endif\nelse (是否分析任务失败?)\n    if (磁盘配额不足且用户代码错误?) then (是)\n        :定义为任务级资源与代码复合故障;\n        :基于历史案例库进行智能诊断;\n    else (否)\n        :定义为任务级单一故障;\n        :记录日志并通知运维人员;\n    endif\nendif\n\nstop\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="WCmOskbB8PCnRr3giRuo-2">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="-620" y="-380" width="1243" height="333.79" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\n\n&#39; 设置主题和字体\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam actorFontName Arial\nskinparam participantFontName Arial\nskinparam sequenceDiagram {\n    ArrowColor Black\n    LifelineColor Black\n    BackgroundColor White\n}\n\n&#39; 定义参与者\nactor 用户\nparticipant HTTP服务器\nparticipant CPU轮询器\nparticipant 内存轮询器\nparticipant 磁盘轮询器\nparticipant GPU轮询器\n\n&#39; 用户发起请求\n用户 -&gt; HTTP服务器: 请求 /metrics\nnote right of HTTP服务器: 各轮询器周期性独立收集数据，并存储在内存/存储中以响应用户请求\n\n&#39; 各个轮询器的周期性数据收集\nactivate CPU轮询器\nCPU轮询器 --&gt; HTTP服务器: 轮询 CPU\nnote left of CPU轮询器: CPU状态\ndeactivate CPU轮询器\n\nactivate 内存轮询器\n内存轮询器 --&gt; HTTP服务器: 轮询 内存\nnote left of 内存轮询器: 内存状态\ndeactivate 内存轮询器\n\nactivate 磁盘轮询器\n磁盘轮询器 --&gt; HTTP服务器: 轮询 磁盘\nnote left of 磁盘轮询器: 磁盘状态\ndeactivate 磁盘轮询器\n\nactivate GPU轮询器\nGPU轮询器 --&gt; HTTP服务器: 轮询 GPU\nnote left of GPU轮询器: GPU状态\ndeactivate GPU轮询器\n\n&#39; 返回结果\nHTTP服务器 -&gt; 用户: 返回 /metrics\nnote left of 用户: 返回各轮询器的状态信息\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="XPRo1kth5KRRXANsniBF-1">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="-610" y="-360" width="714" height="550" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="XPRo1kth5KRRXANsniBF-2" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry width="100" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-430" y="-520" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="-330" y="-520" as="targetPoint" />
            <Array as="points" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n\n&#39; 定义节点\nkernel -&gt; Intercept kernel : 1. 截获 kernel\nIntercept kernel -&gt; EventPool : 2. 获取 event\nEventPool -&gt; Intercept kernel : 6. 返还 event\nIntercept kernel -&gt; WorkingQueue : 3. 记录后推送至队列\nWorkingQueue -&gt; GPU Timer Manager : 4. 获取 ready event\n\n&#39; 工作线程分支\nGPU Timer Manager -&gt; Bvar Prometheus : 5. 聚合指标\nBvar Prometheus -&gt; [投递指标] : 投递指标\n\nGPU Timer Manager -&gt; StackDumper : 5. 打栈分析\nStackDumper -&gt; [栈分析] : 栈分析\n\nGPU Timer Manager -&gt; KernelTrace Manager : 5. 产出 trace\nKernelTrace Manager -&gt; [产出 timeline] : 产出 timeline\n\n&#39; RESTFUL 指令\n[RESTFUL 指令] -&gt; GPU Timer Manager : 控制指令\n\n&#39; 设置布局和样式\nskinparam {\n    ArrowColor DarkBlue\n    ArrowThickness 2\n    NoteFontColor Black\n    NoteBackgroundColor LightYellow\n}\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="XPRo1kth5KRRXANsniBF-3">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="-550" y="-546" width="394" height="166" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
